### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = 

### 1. Health Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Create Geofence (Delivery Zone)
# @name createGeofence
POST {{baseUrl}}/geofences
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Market Street Delivery Hub",
  "category": "delivery_zone",
  "description": "High-density retail delivery perimeter",
  "coordinates": [
    [37.7749, -122.4194],
    [37.7849, -122.4194],
    [37.7849, -122.4094],
    [37.7749, -122.4094],
    [37.7749, -122.4194]
  ]
}

### Store Geofence ID
@geofenceId = {{createGeofence.response.body.geofence_id}}

### 3. List Geofences
GET {{baseUrl}}/geofences?category=delivery_zone
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Register Vehicle
# @name createVehicle
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicle_number": "TRK-HTTP-99",
  "driver_name": "Taylor Hayes",
  "vehicle_type": "truck",
  "phone": "+1 415-555-0199"
}

### Store Vehicle ID
@vehicleId = {{createVehicle.response.body.vehicle_id}}

### 5. List Vehicles
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Configure Alert Rule
# @name createAlert
POST {{baseUrl}}/alerts/configure
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "geofence_id": "{{geofenceId}}",
  "vehicle_id": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "event_type": "both"
}

### Store Alert ID
@alertId = {{createAlert.response.body.alert_id}}

### 7. List Configured Alert Rules
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts?geofence_id={{geofenceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Transmit Vehicle Location (Inside Geofence)
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/location
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicle_id": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "latitude": 37.7780,
  "longitude": -122.4140,
  "timestamp": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z"
}

### 9. Get Current Vehicle Location
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/location/{{vehicleId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. Query Violation History (with limit & offset)
GET {{baseUrl}}/violations/history?limit=25&offset=0
Content-Type: application/json

### 11. Delete Configured Alert Rule
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/alerts/{{alertId}}
Content-Type: application/json
